    media: act on a command socket the peer closed

    Q61NHQ-23012

    libuv does report the peer close, but nothing acts on it: read_cb only
    closes the pipe, and media_uv_free_proxy stays silent until a disconnect
    the user has no reason to ask for. So a request already on the wire is
    dropped without a trace, and a reconnect asked for meanwhile is applied
    only once a response arrives, which that socket can no longer deliver.

